          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ On Day 7, he achieved 150% of his target. On Day 8, he achieved 210% of his target. Find the sales made on these days."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.131,
            0.848,
            0.24
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Suppose on some day, he made ₹2500. This can be expressed as “He achieved "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of his target” or “He achieved 50% of his target” or “He achieved 0.5 of his target”. On some other day, he made ₹10,000. We can say “He achieved twice/double/2 times his target” or “He achieved 200% of his target”."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.249,
            0.847,
            0.289
          ],
          "content": [
