          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Example 7: A farmer harvested 260 kg of wheat last year. This year, they harvested 650 kg of wheat. What percentage of last year’s harvest is this year’s harvest?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.632,
            0.74,
            0.677
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This year’s harvest "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{650}{260} \\times 100 = 250\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of last year’s harvest. 250% indicates that it is 2.5 times the original value."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.685,
            0.295,
            0.707
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
